/* H2_SOUND_TABLE.INC: the Halo 2 sounds that play as the Halo 2 level's stand-in sounds (h2_sound.c).

A row: the stand-in sound's tag name (the Custom Edition sound of the globals' pack the level carries), the
Halo 2 sound tags that replace it (names without their "sound" folder's extension, as the maps spell
them, '|' apart: their permutations are taken together, at most 32 evenly; a name that begins "1:" gives only
the first pitch range's, for the engine loops, whose ranges are engine speeds), and a trim in dB added to the
gain Halo 2 sets (0 where none is needed). A row whose stand-in the level does not have is left alone (a
branch with its own weapon tags adds rows for them), and a stand-in with no row stays the Custom Edition
sound. docs/h2_sound_table.md is this table for reading. */

